+   * kernels. The size of the pool of memory of hypre on the GPU can't be
+   * given by the option `--hypre-device-pool-size` (the environment
+   * variable is accepted).
+   *
    * The option `--kokkos` (or `-kk`, `--no-kokkos` and `-no-kk` cancelling
    * it), or else the environment variable `MFEM_MGIS_KOKKOS` (any non empty
    * value other than `0`), initializes Kokkos after the device of MFEM, on
diff --git a/src/Config.cxx b/src/Config.cxx
index 9816f7c29d..4287d676a1 100644
